# Source-grounded recipe: Wave VIII — Union, CD4-7.
# The tape's preparatory process is expanded through the existing reusable
# components; its authored exercise remains one segment rather than being
# paraphrased here. No generic briefing, Clear Skies or extra hold is added.
# The source enters from Focus 12 and lets awareness move automatically to the appropriate state; the F27 cue records the authored destination without inventing a counted climb.
# Wave VIII replaces the earlier induction affirmation with its fixed service form.

@title    Inner Earth
@level    F10
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     20040
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use orientation

surf 0.30
use conversion-box

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon
use affirmation-service

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use climb-f10-f12
level F27
use inner-earth
level F10
use return-one
